# one loyalty counter left. On turn 3 Bot1 casts Lightning Bolt: Ral triggers; with the trigger on the stack Bot2 kills Ral with its own
# Lightning Bolt (3 damage), so Ral is gone when the ability resolves and no counter goes anywhere: Ral stays in the graveyard and no
# permanent has a loyalty counter.

